Description: The libbson BSON serialization library.
Version: 1.12.0
Libs: -L${libdir} -lbson-static-1.0  /opt/CompiledFiles/Dependencies/Binaries/Malterlib_Linux/SDKs/Linux2.6.sdk/usr/lib32/librt.so /opt/CompiledFiles/Dependencies/Binaries/Malterlib_Linux/SDKs/Linux2.6.sdk/usr/lib32/libm.so
Cflags: -I${includedir}/libbson-1.0 -DBSON_STATIC
